        body: "# Outline of the selected file\n\nCode › Outline shows the indexed outline of the source file selected in the Explorer header. The target is retained per project and does not depend on an active text editor.\n\n## Limits\n\nThe outline comes from the published index, not from unsaved editor changes.\n\n## Choosing the file\n\nUse Choose file in the Explorer header to select an open editor tab or browse another file in the project. Open a file in the editor, then return to Explorer; the target survives focus changes and is retained per project. A file from another open AIRK project identifies its project switch. Source links open beside Explorer. Refresh outline rereads indexed evidence for this target; no live buffer or file is indexed by selecting it."
